brand: CAPiTA
model name: Defenders of Awesome (DOA)
model year: 2027
AUD price: $999.99
status: Preorder
estimated availability: May 1, 2026
board type: All Mountain
flex: 5.5/10
ability level: Intermediate
shape: Twin (symmetrical, identical tip and tail, equal performance forward or switch)
camber type: Resort V1 + Flat Kick Tech (combines traditional camber, zero camber, and reverse camber with Flat Kick Tech for pop and response of cambered board with predictability and effortless turn initiation)
sidecut type: Blended Radial (single-radius arc through midsection with custom blend zones at contact points)
width options: Standard, Wide
mounting pattern: 2x4 Inserts
available lengths: 148cm, 150cm, 152cm, 154cm, 156cm, 158cm, 160cm, 162cm, 155cm Wide, 157cm Wide, 159cm Wide, 161cm Wide, 163cm Wide
topsheet: PLT Technology - Digital and Screen Print with Metallic Underlay (bonds topsheet without fiberglass structure showing through, no additional lacquer layer, reduces weight and environmentally unfriendly materials)
printing technology: PAM16000 (16,000 individual inkjet nozzles, solventless water-based UV ink, plus hand screen printing)
laminate: Hybrid Carbon HolySheet Bi/Bi (bi-axial fiberglass above and below core with additional carbon interwoven into bottom layer, structural additives to fine-tune ride characteristics, high forgiveness, reduced weight)
resin: Magic Bean Resin (plant-based, high bio-content, zero waste, no greenhouse emissions, low production temperatures, enhanced rigidity allows thinner wood core)
core: P2 Superlight Core (Paulownia and Poplar wood, lightweight, high impact durability, maximum pop)
base: Quantum Drive Base - Sublimation Print (sintered, holds more wax, fast, durable)
terrain: All Mountain (groomed runs, off-piste, versatile)
riding style: All Mountain, freestyle, carving
awards: Numerous consecutive Transworld Good Wood awards
base colour note: Base colours are size dependent and cannot be swapped between sizes
